@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

actor Officer
actor "Control-room operator" as Operator
actor Supervisor
cloud "Cellular network\n(SIM only)" as Cellular
rectangle "Wearable device" as Device {
  component "GPS & geofence"
  component "Emergency prompts"
  component "Basic camera / voice"
  component "Device identity & OTA agent"
}
frame "Azure Singapore" {
  component "API Management" as APIM
  component "Sentinel API\n(FastAPI service)" as API
  component "Device management\nand provisioning" as DeviceMgmt
  queue "Event Hubs" as Events
  database "Operational data\nand audit logs" as Data
  component "Azure AI Search\nApproved site SOPs" as Search
  component "Azure OpenAI\nGuardrailed RAG" as OpenAI
  component "Control-room console" as Console
  component "Key Vault +\nManaged identities" as KV
  component "Azure Monitor +\nMicrosoft Sentinel" as Monitor
}
cloud "Approved SOP sources\nand regulator formats" as SOP

Officer --> Device
Device --> Cellular : encrypted telemetry, alerts,
voice requests, GPS
Cellular --> APIM
APIM --> API : device and role validation
API --> Events : auditable events
Events --> Data
API --> Search : authorized retrieval
Search --> OpenAI
OpenAI --> API : cited guidance / report draft
API --> Console : alerts and workflows
Operator --> Console
Supervisor --> Console : site-level data only
SOP --> Search : approved ingestion
DeviceMgmt --> Device : provisioning, OTA status
KV ..> APIM
KV ..> API
Monitor ..> APIM
Monitor ..> API
Monitor ..> Events
note bottom of OpenAI
Security-domain queries only.
Human approval is required
before report submission.
end note
note bottom of Data
Provisional policy:
audio 30 days;
transcripts/reports 2 years.
end note
@enduml
